{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"nim","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Nim","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Nim (.nim .nims .nimble).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"nim","name":"Nim","extensions":[".nim",".nims",".nimble"],"grammar":"grammars/nim.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["#[","]#"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Nim","path":"snippets/nim.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/nim.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#\\\\[\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\]#\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\.[^}]*\\\\.\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:converter|interface|continue|distinct|iterator|template|concept|discard|finally|include|except|export|import|method|object|return|static|block|break|const|defer|isnot|macro|mixin|notin|raise|tuple|using|while|yield|addr|bind|case|cast|elif|else|enum|from|func|proc|type|when|and|asm|div|end|for|let|mod|nil|not|out|ptr|ref|shl|shr|try|var|xor|as|do|if|in|is|of|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:openArray|float32|float64|HashSet|uint16|uint32|uint64|string|Option|int16|int32|int64|uint8|float|array|Table|int8|uint|bool|char|void|auto|int|seq|set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:newSeq|assert|echo|repr|quit|len|add|inc|dec)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/nim.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Proc\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"proc ${1:name}(${2:arg}: ${3:int}): ${4:void} =\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A procedure\"\n  },\n  \"Type object\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"type\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type\",\n      \"  ${1:Name} = object\",\n      \"    ${2:field}: ${3:int}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An object type\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:i} in ${2:0 ..< 10}:\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  },\n  \"Echo\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"echo ${1:\\\"hello\\\"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"echo\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Nim\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Nim.\n\n## Files\n\n`.nim`, `.nims`, `.nimble`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `proc` | A procedure |\n| `type` | An object type |\n| `for` | A for loop |\n| `ec` | echo |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}